 #Access specifies/Modifiers in Python propramming are used to limit the access of class variable and class method outside of class in while implemating the concept of inheritance.

#Public access specifier in python #All the variable and methed in python are by default public. Any instance variable in a class Followed by "self" key word is self_var_name are public accessed

